      "created_at": "2024-09-25T12:07:18Z",
      "updated_at": "2024-09-25T12:07:18Z",
      "body": "I played around with this, and even manually reinitializing `stdscr` with `initscr` still causes `wrefresh` to crash. If it was just the case of something in `stdscr` being `NULL`, I would expect that to fix it.\r\n\r\nI'm closing this as an upstream issue and reporting it to the GNU mailing lists.",
