      "created_at": "2024-09-25T15:48:52Z",
      "updated_at": "2024-09-25T15:48:52Z",
      "body": "According to GNU, it seems the function is erroneously documented as taking integers, while in reality they are `short`s. A workaround for us is to disallow negatives and raise an exception for anything above the signed 16 bit integer limit. I'll get to this later today.",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "pin": null,
