      "created_at": "2024-09-25T22:17:58Z",
      "updated_at": "2024-09-25T22:17:58Z",
      "body": "I was corrected on the mailing list: the functions don't necessarily take `short`, but rather store a `short` internally (at least, that was my understanding of it). It seems that they are working on fixing the crash on their end, but I've created #124555 as a bandaid for us.",
